{"language":"jp","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","噜噜冲锋"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/jp","ルルの突撃"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","对一条直线上的敌人发起冲锋造成伤害并击退至终点。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/jp","直線上の敵に突撃し、ダメージを与え、端まで後退させる"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","选择范围内一条直线方向上的一个地图格发起冲锋，将沿途目标击退至终点附近。冲锋结束后对邻格范围内的敌人造成240% + 30% ATK伤害，并嘲讽其3秒。施法期间处于霸体状态。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","範囲内の直線上の1マスを選んで突撃し、経路上の敵を端まで後退させる。突撃後、隣接マスの敵に240% + 30% ATKのダメージを与え、対象に3秒間の挑発を付与。スキル発動中、スーパーアーマー状態になる"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":56,"end":62,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":49,"end":55,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":52,"end":66,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":70,"end":72,"tooltip_key":"keyword:taunt"},{"start":82,"end":84,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":45,"end":59,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":75,"end":77,"tooltip_key":"keyword:taunt"},{"start":88,"end":96,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至260% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが260% + 30% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","嘲讽时长提升至4秒。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","挑発の持続時間が4秒にUP"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":0,"end":2,"to